<title>USA: Michigan City Pk Dist., Ind., won by Griffin Kubik.</title>
<headline>Michigan City Pk Dist., Ind., won by Griffin Kubik.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Griffin Kubik said it won $3.500 million of Michigan City Park City, Ind., park district bonds, 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.080 percent.</p>
</text>
